{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/15383","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/15383/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/15383/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/15383/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/15383","id":388096747,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzODgwOTY3NDc=","number":15383,"title":"Incorrect build of threejs on windows","user":{"login":"cnstoba","id":40198709,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTk4NzA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40198709?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cnstoba","html_url":"https://github.com/cnstoba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cnstoba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cnstoba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cnstoba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cnstoba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cnstoba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cnstoba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cnstoba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cnstoba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cnstoba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":58674,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODY3NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2018-12-06T07:59:55Z","updated_at":"2020-03-22T03:29:59Z","closed_at":"2018-12-11T00:46:05Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"##### Description of the problem\r\n\r\nWith the current stable version you cannot build threejs correctly on windows. There was a change to the ShaderChunk system (refering to [#15280](https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/pull/15280)) with all glsl.js files using backticks now, which of course will not work in browsers that are not es6 compatible (like IE11). \r\n\r\nNow during build, rollup is performed and the glsl() - function in the rollup.config.js should replace the code inside of the backticks, as well as the backticks themselves. However the regex in line 165:\r\n\r\n**/\\`((.*|\\n)*)\\`/**\r\n\r\nwill never match if you clone the repository on windows because windows line endings are always \\r\\n and not just \\n like on mac. So the backticks code won't get replaced.\r\n\r\nIdeas to solve this issue are:\r\n  - change the .gitattributes file and replace \"text=auto\" with \"text eol = lf\" so when cloning the \r\n     repo lineendings will always be \\n.\r\n  - Change the regex so that it matches the \\r\\n case as well.\r\n\r\n##### Three.js version\r\n\r\n- r99\r\n\r\n##### Browser\r\n\r\n- Especially IE11\r\n\r\n##### OS\r\n\r\n- Windows\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"mrdoob","id":97088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3MDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/15383/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/15383/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}